    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Swift FSE Blocks</strong> gives you the freedom to design your WordPress site visually — faster, smarter, and without code.</p>\n<p>Built for the <strong>Full Site Editing (FSE)</strong> experience, Swift FSE Blocks offers a growing collection of beautifully designed, performance-optimized blocks that help you create stunning layouts in minutes.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re building a landing page, portfolio, or blog, Swift FSE Blocks integrates seamlessly with the WordPress Site Editor to help you bring your creative vision to life.</p>\n<h3>Why Choose Swift FSE Blocks?</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>No code required:</strong> Create professional designs visually inside the editor.</li>\n<li><strong>SCF/ACF-COmpatible:</strong> Get and use dynamic data from your SCF fields on any page or templates.  </li>\n<li><strong>Blazing fast:</strong> Lightweight and built with performance in mind.  </li>\n<li><strong>Modern design:</strong> Stylish, responsive, and mobile-ready out of the box.  </li>\n<li><strong>FSE ready:</strong> Works flawlessly with WordPress block and full-site editing themes.  </li>\n<li><strong>Seamless customization:</strong> Tweak spacing, colors, and typography with intuitive controls.  </li>\n<li><strong>Developer friendly:</strong> Clean, extensible code following WordPress standards.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Start designing your site the modern WordPress way — simple, fast, and flexible.</p>\n<h3>Additional Information</h3>\n<p>Swift FSE Blocks helps you <strong>design faster and smarter</strong> using the power of WordPress Full Site Editing.<br />\nPerfect for freelancers, creators, and business owners who want to launch beautiful, high-performing websites — no coding required.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/swift-fse-blocks</code> directory, or install directly from the WordPress Plugin Directory.</li>\n<li>Activate <strong>Swift FSE Blocks</strong> from the <em>Plugins</em> screen.</li>\n<li>Open the Site Editor or Block Editor — your new Swift FSE Blocks will be ready to use.</li>\n<li>Add blocks to any page or template, then customize them to match your brand.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"what%20is%20swift%20fse%20blocks%3F\">\nWhat is Swift FSE Blocks?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Swift FSE Blocks is a modern collection of custom WordPress blocks built for the Full Site Editing experience. It enhances your design workflow with flexible, easy-to-use components.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"do%20i%20need%20a%20specific%20theme%20to%20use%20it%3F\">\nDo I need a specific theme to use it?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You’ll get the best results using a <strong>Full Site Editing (FSE)</strong> compatible theme, such as Twenty Twenty-Four or any modern block-based theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"are%20these%20blocks%20responsive%3F\">\nAre these blocks responsive?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes — every block is <strong>fully responsive</strong> and automatically adapts to different screen sizes, from desktop to mobile.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20customize%20the%20styles%3F\">\nCan I customize the styles?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Definitely! You can fine-tune layouts, colors, and spacing right inside the editor, or add custom CSS for advanced control.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20slow%20down%20my%20site%3F\">\nDoes it slow down my site?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Not at all. Swift FSE Blocks is designed to be <strong>lightweight and optimized</strong>, using only minimal assets for maximum speed.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release with core FSE blocks and customization options.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Build beautiful, fast WordPress sites with flexible Full Site Editing blocks — made for devs, freelancers, and DIY creators.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Swift FSE Blocks</strong> gives you the freedom to design your WordPress site visually — faster, smarter, and without code.</p>\n<p>Built for the <strong>Full Site Editing (FSE)</strong> experience, Swift FSE Blocks offers a growing collection of beautifully designed, performance-optimized blocks that help you create stunning layouts in minutes.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re building a landing page, portfolio, or blog, Swift FSE Blocks integrates seamlessly with the WordPress Site Editor to help you bring your creative vision to life.</p>\n<h3>Why Choose Swift FSE Blocks?</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>No code required:</strong> Create professional designs visually inside the editor.</li>\n<li><strong>SCF/ACF-COmpatible:</strong> Get and use dynamic data from your SCF fields on any page or templates.  </li>\n<li><strong>Blazing fast:</strong> Lightweight and built with performance in mind.  </li>\n<li><strong>Modern design:</strong> Stylish, responsive, and mobile-ready out of the box.  </li>\n<li><strong>FSE ready:</strong> Works flawlessly with WordPress block and full-site editing themes.  </li>\n<li><strong>Seamless customization:</strong> Tweak spacing, colors, and typography with intuitive controls.  </li>\n<li><strong>Developer friendly:</strong> Clean, extensible code following WordPress standards.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Start designing your site the modern WordPress way — simple, fast, and flexible.</p>\n<h3>Additional Information</h3>\n<p>Swift FSE Blocks helps you <strong>design faster and smarter</strong> using the power of WordPress Full Site Editing.<br />\nPerfect for freelancers, creators, and business owners who want to launch beautiful, high-performing websites — no coding required.</p>\n",
